                "text": "Yesterday, every single Republican in the House voted for a bill that would undercut Medicare\u2019s ability to negotiate lower prescription drug prices for you and your families. I\u2019m continuing to fight back against their attempts to raise drug costs and line Big Pharma\u2019s coffers.",
