                "text": "Today, I met with representatives from GE HealthCare Women\u2019s Health to learn more about the nation's first One-Stop Breast Cancer clinic at St. Luke\u2019s Health Network, which will help breast cancer patients in our community get the care they need faster. Thanks for stopping by! https://t.co/xQAKjDR4Xd",
